---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro'
---

<Base meta={{ title: 'About' }}>
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium tracking-wide text-accentColor w500:text-lg">
    About
  </h2>

  <div class="mt-4 tracking-wide leading-8 w500:text-sm w500:leading-[2.2]">
    <p>
      I'm Julius Le, a builder and founder interested in technology,
      systems, and the process of turning ideas into things that work.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4">
      This is my personal space for essays, ideas, notes, and reflections
      on technology, building, and life.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4">
      I write here to think more clearly, preserve what I learn,
      and explore ideas that are worth returning to.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4">
      For my projects and work, visit
      <a
        class="underline"
        href="https://juliustellar.github.io"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        my portfolio
      </a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>